#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:110
msgid "Watermarking"
msgstr "Filigrane"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:131
msgid "Watermarking Gallery Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres du filigrane"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:135
msgid ""
"The settings below adjust the Watermarking options for the Gallery output."
msgstr ""
"Les paramètres ci-dessous réglent les options de filigrane pour l'affichage "
"de la galerie."

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:142
msgid "Need some help?"
msgstr "Besoin d’aide ?"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:144
msgid "Read the Documentation"
msgstr "Lire la documentation"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:148
msgid "Watch a Video"
msgstr "Regarder une vidéo"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:161
msgid "Enabled?"
msgstr "Activé ?"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:165
msgid ""
"Enables or disables the Watermarking of images uploaded to this Gallery."
msgstr ""
"Active ou désactive le filigrane sur les images téléversées dans cette "
"galerie."

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:170
msgid "Watermark"
msgstr "Filigrane"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:198
msgid "Change Watermark"
msgstr "Changer de filigrane"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:200
msgid "Choose Watermark"
msgstr "Choisissez le filigrane"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:206
msgid "The image to use as the watermark."
msgstr "L’image à utiliser en tant que filigrane."

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:211
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Position"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:219
msgid "Define where to position the watermark over the image."
msgstr "Définit où placer le filigrane sur l’image."

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:224
msgid "Margin"
msgstr "Marge"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:227
msgid "px"
msgstr "px"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:228
msgid "Sets the space between the edge of the image and the watermark."
msgstr "Définit l’espace entre le bord de l’image et le filigrane."

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:233
msgid "Apply to Existing Images?"
msgstr "Appliquer aux images existantes ?"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:236
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Appliquer"

#: includes/admin/metaboxes.php:237
msgid ""
"Use this option to apply your watermark to any images uploaded to this "
"Gallery before the Watermark was defined. Any images that already have a "
"watermark will not be changed. You must have already selected an image and "
"updated the gallery to apply."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option pour appliquer votre filigrane à toutes les images "
"téléversées dans cette galerie avant que le filigrane ait été défini. Toutes "
"les images qui ont déjà un filigrane ne seront pas modifiées. Vous devez "
"déjà avoir sélectionné une image et mis à jour la galerie pour l'appliquer."

#: includes/global/common.php:84
msgid "Top Left"
msgstr "En haut à gauche"

#: includes/global/common.php:88
msgid "Top Right"
msgstr "En haut à droite"

#: includes/global/common.php:92
msgid "Center"
msgstr "Au centre"

#: includes/global/common.php:96
msgid "Bottom Left"
msgstr "En bas à gauche"

#: includes/global/common.php:100
msgid "Bottom Right"
msgstr "En bas à droite"

#. Plugin Name of the plugin/theme
msgid "Envira Gallery - Watermarking Addon"
msgstr "Envira Gallery - Watermarking Addon (Filigrane)"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme
#. Author URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "http://enviragallery.com"
msgstr "http://enviragallery.com"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid "Add a watermark to your Envira Gallery images"
msgstr "Ajouter un filigrane à vos images dans Envira Gallery"

#. Author of the plugin/theme
msgid "Envira Gallery Team"
msgstr "Équipe de Envira Gallery"

